WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:13.055
[rock music playing]

00:43.043 --> 00:47.173
CHAPTER 39: USE A BIT OF SENSE
AND FIGURE IT OUT YOURSELF

00:47.256 --> 00:48.924
[Eui-ju panting]

00:49.008 --> 00:51.635
Mr. Ga! Mr. Ga. Wait, Mr. Ga.

00:51.719 --> 00:55.556
Sir, I have something to tell you!
Wait just a moment. Wait, Mr. Ga.

00:56.056 --> 00:58.100
Hold on. [panting]

01:01.103 --> 01:02.146
Just a second.

01:05.900 --> 01:06.901
What is it?

01:08.402 --> 01:11.322
[hopeful, tender music playing]

01:16.285 --> 01:17.620
I…

01:23.125 --> 01:24.126
I…

01:28.214 --> 01:30.549
The after-school class is too much for me!

01:32.384 --> 01:34.220
[owl hoots]

01:34.303 --> 01:35.971
[exhales heavily]

01:37.139 --> 01:38.140
What?

01:39.517 --> 01:40.851
[sighs] I…

01:41.894 --> 01:43.312
I keep…

01:43.395 --> 01:44.814
[comical music playing]

01:44.897 --> 01:47.107
[sighs] …skipping my homework,

01:48.108 --> 01:51.237
and dragging the rest of the class down.

01:52.488 --> 01:54.532
It's emotionally exhausting.

01:54.615 --> 01:56.784
This sense of guilt
is taking a toll on me.

01:57.993 --> 01:58.994
[sobs]

02:00.287 --> 02:02.581
Can't you find
any motivation to give math a shot?

02:02.665 --> 02:03.666
[pants]

02:03.749 --> 02:06.252
What happened to your promise
from ten years ago?

02:06.335 --> 02:07.962
You sounded so sure back then.

02:08.546 --> 02:10.714
[stammers] Huh?

02:11.507 --> 02:14.260
I'm talking about you. Yeo Eui-ju.

02:17.930 --> 02:19.557
About me? Really?

02:20.683 --> 02:23.644
I had no doubt in my mind
that you'd be good at math.

02:27.940 --> 02:28.941
But…

02:30.025 --> 02:33.237
You said I made
a promise to you? What promise?

02:34.572 --> 02:35.573
Forget it.

02:37.366 --> 02:40.119
Huh? Mr. Ga. Hold on, please.

02:40.202 --> 02:41.203
EPISODE 13

02:41.287 --> 02:43.831
I don't understand
what kind of promise you're talking about.

02:43.914 --> 02:45.416
Mr. Ga! Oh.

02:47.042 --> 02:48.377
Did you clean the classroom?

02:48.460 --> 02:51.046
[stammers] I forgot.

02:54.675 --> 02:55.885
Goodbye then.

02:59.555 --> 03:00.556
[huffs]

03:08.564 --> 03:10.774
[curious music playing]

03:15.237 --> 03:16.238
A promise?

03:17.156 --> 03:19.700
I don't think I can do it.

03:20.409 --> 03:22.119
I just can't do it.

03:22.202 --> 03:24.455
Then just write him a love letter.

03:24.538 --> 03:26.832
-A letter?
-Yes. You're a writer.

03:26.916 --> 03:28.542
Use your writing and confess.

03:30.210 --> 03:31.211
Confess?

03:34.214 --> 03:35.215
[ding plays]

03:35.883 --> 03:37.259
[mischievous music playing]

03:37.343 --> 03:39.261
WE WERE FRIENDS - EPISODE 9

03:42.264 --> 03:43.933
[scoffs]

03:44.016 --> 03:45.017
I'm here.

03:47.811 --> 03:51.523
Oh, I wonder why
I didn't think of this earlier. Huh?

03:52.900 --> 03:56.236
I can just confess my feelings
for him through my writing here.

03:56.820 --> 03:58.238
Eat up. I know you're hungry.

03:58.322 --> 03:59.615
This looks great.

04:04.578 --> 04:05.579
Did you choose me?

04:06.163 --> 04:08.958
Or do you just wanna get away
from Kang Tae-ha?

04:09.833 --> 04:12.044
-What's the difference?
-There's a huge difference!

04:15.673 --> 04:17.591
I don't wanna be someone's refuge.

04:18.467 --> 04:20.803
It's just too painful to think of Tae-ha.

04:21.637 --> 04:24.515
But I feel a little more at ease
when I'm with you.

04:24.598 --> 04:27.559
So, that's all I am to you?
A little bit of comfort.

04:29.228 --> 04:31.647
-That's harsh.
-[patrons murmuring]

04:32.314 --> 04:34.441
I'm sorry for being selfish.

04:34.525 --> 04:36.026
It's okay, I'm just as selfish.

04:37.069 --> 04:39.321
If I stay by your side
when you're confused,

04:39.405 --> 04:40.948
maybe you'll choose me in the end.

04:41.031 --> 04:44.785
IN THAT MOMENT,
YOON DECIDED TO SHOOT HIS SHOT

04:45.911 --> 04:47.454
Si-on, I like you.

04:48.580 --> 04:50.958
[comical, awkward music playing]

04:52.042 --> 04:53.043
[sighs]

04:54.837 --> 04:55.879
The truth is…

04:57.214 --> 05:00.592
I've had a crush on you for a long time.
Since we were in high school.

05:02.970 --> 05:04.054
[groans]

05:04.138 --> 05:07.808
If I don't tell you today,
I might just regret it forever.

05:11.770 --> 05:12.771
[sighs]

05:17.401 --> 05:19.778
How can you not see how I feel?
Isn't it obvious?

05:19.862 --> 05:23.115
Can't you just use some common sense
and figure it out on your own?

05:26.243 --> 05:27.286
I have feelings for you.

05:27.369 --> 05:28.746
Every time you see me…

05:29.747 --> 05:32.541
[gulps, stutters]
…my heart races like crazy.

05:33.667 --> 05:36.712
I get so nervous
when I see you or walk past you.

05:38.088 --> 05:39.173
It's happening right now.

05:39.798 --> 05:42.051
When you gave me a hard time
and were mean only to me,

05:42.134 --> 05:44.511
even when you embarrassed me
for being bad at math.

05:45.345 --> 05:46.805
I never hated you, you know?

05:47.681 --> 05:49.933
I like you. I like you.

05:50.017 --> 05:51.226
I like you, Ju Si-on!

05:52.061 --> 05:53.270
[shudders]

05:56.065 --> 05:57.066
[sighs]

05:57.149 --> 05:59.193
[patrons applauding]

06:04.907 --> 06:05.908
[chuckles]

06:07.242 --> 06:08.243
[sighs]

06:09.745 --> 06:12.206
So, you couldn't write the letter?

06:12.289 --> 06:15.959
[clicks tongue]
Well. Maybe I'll do it later.

06:16.043 --> 06:18.003
-Geez. When exactly?
-[chuckles]

06:19.004 --> 06:23.801
But I don't think
that It'll make any difference.

06:23.884 --> 06:27.471
Even if muster up the courage
to express my feelings for him,

06:27.554 --> 06:30.682
he obviously won't like me back.

06:32.017 --> 06:33.769
-Hello, Mr. Ga.
-Hello, Mr. Ga.

06:33.852 --> 06:35.229
Hello, Mr. Ga.

06:38.524 --> 06:40.234
[student] Did you see that?

06:40.317 --> 06:43.779
[whispering] Go on. Go on.
Come on, go talk to him.

06:45.239 --> 06:46.406
Mr. Ga.

06:46.490 --> 06:47.658
[stammers, clears throat]

06:47.741 --> 06:49.076
[sniffles] Di…

06:49.159 --> 06:52.329
Did you perhaps read the new episode
that I posted yesterday?

06:53.038 --> 06:54.540
[stutters] What did you think?

06:54.623 --> 06:56.416
[comical music playing]

06:56.500 --> 06:58.293
Choi Yoon's sudden change seemed off.

06:59.586 --> 07:01.547
Why would he say that? It was too random.

07:08.137 --> 07:09.138
What's wrong?

07:10.055 --> 07:11.723
What? What did he say?

07:12.224 --> 07:13.225
Nothing.

07:14.810 --> 07:16.520
-[sniffles] Let's go.
-Huh?

07:18.647 --> 07:20.691
[class] Good morning!

07:21.859 --> 07:23.527
Did everyone bring
their homework assignments?

07:23.610 --> 07:25.028
[class] Yes.

07:25.112 --> 07:27.739
[Woo-su] Don't think about finishing
them now. Please turn them in.

07:27.823 --> 07:29.199
[students] Okay.

07:30.117 --> 07:31.160
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

07:39.918 --> 07:40.961
[giggling]

07:43.005 --> 07:44.256
Who didn't do it?

07:47.176 --> 07:48.427
Me.

07:50.012 --> 07:51.013
Stand up.

07:55.934 --> 07:57.186
Why didn't you do it?

07:58.103 --> 07:59.646
I forgot about it.

08:00.397 --> 08:01.398
You forgot?

08:02.065 --> 08:03.901
How could you forget doing it?

08:03.984 --> 08:07.029
What's your priority among all the things
you have to do? Isn't it studying?

08:07.112 --> 08:08.739
And doing homework?

08:09.990 --> 08:11.491
Are you gonna keep this up?

08:13.076 --> 08:14.077
No, sir.

08:14.161 --> 08:16.121
Add more problems
to the assignment you didn't do,

08:16.205 --> 08:17.664
and bring it in by tomorrow.

08:19.041 --> 08:20.042
Yes, sir.

08:20.125 --> 08:21.126
Sit down.

08:27.007 --> 08:28.175
Turn to page 99.

08:28.258 --> 08:32.054
[whispers] Did you do something wrong?
Why is he so harsh on you?

08:33.222 --> 08:35.515
I don't know. I'm screwed.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.189
Why do you think math is so strict?

08:42.272 --> 08:43.565
CHAPTER 40:
YOU THINK YOU COULD HIDE IT?

08:43.649 --> 08:47.402
He says there will never be partial points
for any of the math quizzes we take. Ugh.

08:47.486 --> 08:50.656
[sighs] He's cold-blooded after all.
He's like an AI.

08:52.324 --> 08:55.035
He's just doing it his way, isn't he?

08:55.118 --> 08:56.495
That might actually be fair.

08:57.162 --> 08:59.039
What're you talking about?

08:59.122 --> 09:01.458
So what if he has a handsome face?

09:01.541 --> 09:03.210
My point, exactly.

09:03.293 --> 09:07.256
That's what makes him even more annoying,
you know? He looks like a prince.

09:07.339 --> 09:10.509
But his personality is nasty as hell.
It really kills the fantasy.

09:10.592 --> 09:14.137
His personality is not that nasty.
He's just a little cranky.

09:20.102 --> 09:23.188
That's weird for you to say. Huh?
You used to talk crap about him.

09:24.064 --> 09:26.108
Why are you on his side now?

09:28.610 --> 09:30.779
I did? When did I?

09:30.862 --> 09:31.863
[chuckles]

09:32.698 --> 09:33.907
Nuh-uh.

09:35.284 --> 09:38.078
Do you maybe… have a crush on him?

09:38.161 --> 09:39.162
[amusing music playing]

09:39.246 --> 09:40.247
Huh?

09:41.707 --> 09:44.876
Hey! Watch what you say now.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.336
She's not crazy.

09:47.045 --> 09:48.505
[chuckles] Right?

09:48.588 --> 09:50.757
[chuckles] I went too far, didn't I?

09:50.841 --> 09:53.760
-Yeah, you crossed the line.
-I'm sorry. My bad.

09:53.844 --> 09:55.429
[laughs] Time to go. We're off, Eui-ju.

09:59.599 --> 10:01.393
Goodness.

10:01.476 --> 10:04.021
Love and cough
can never be hidden, you know?

10:04.104 --> 10:07.566
[whispers] You think they know?
They couldn't have noticed it, could they?

10:07.649 --> 10:09.860
[sighs] I have to be careful.

10:12.279 --> 10:15.198
Don't you think that web novel
is based on our school?

10:15.282 --> 10:17.701
-You think?
-The characters are like our teachers.

10:17.784 --> 10:21.204
Kang Tae-ha is the PE teacher
and the rich one is the Japanese teacher.

10:21.288 --> 10:22.706
Here, check this out.

10:23.498 --> 10:27.294
"A beige cardigan on his shoulders and
an old brown leather watch on his wrist."

10:27.377 --> 10:30.213
-This is the Korean lit teacher.
-[gasps] You're right.

10:30.297 --> 10:33.050
Actually, I saw him wearing
that same cardigan today.

10:33.133 --> 10:36.053
-I'm telling you.
-And it's the same for math too.

10:36.136 --> 10:40.724
I saw him lift his pinky finger when
he pushed up his glasses in math class.

10:40.807 --> 10:42.309
-Five out of five times.
-Seriously?

10:42.392 --> 10:43.894
-[gasps]
-That's exactly like Ju Si-on.

10:43.977 --> 10:45.771
I'm rooting for Ju Si-on and Choi Yoon.

10:45.854 --> 10:47.689
I'm rooting for Kang Tae-ha and Choi Yoon.

10:47.773 --> 10:48.774
WE WERE FRIENDS

10:48.857 --> 10:52.277
[Ha-su, softly] Ju Si-on.
Kang Tae-ha. Choi Yoon?

10:53.111 --> 10:54.738
…AND TURNS HIS WATCH
TO LOOK AT IT

11:05.165 --> 11:06.666
"Then Si-on says,

11:06.750 --> 11:08.794
-"When a single star is born…"
-"When a single star is born,

11:08.877 --> 11:13.423
a massive cloud of dust surrounds it,
blinding everything in sight."

11:13.507 --> 11:16.927
[both] "That's why people say
stars are born out of chaos."

11:17.010 --> 11:20.597
This problem seems complicated,
but it's simple once you solve it.

11:20.680 --> 11:23.433
No math problem can be
more complex than life,

11:23.517 --> 11:24.976
no matter how difficult it is.

11:26.770 --> 11:29.564
[Ha-su] This is… exactly what Mr. Ga said.

11:30.273 --> 11:32.567
Could someone in my class be writing this?

11:32.651 --> 11:34.444
If she is, it means…

11:35.487 --> 11:37.781
she's also in the after-school program?

11:37.864 --> 11:39.157
Ms. Yeo, put some heart into it.

11:39.241 --> 11:41.701
-I want actual emotion.
-Come on, she can't say that.

11:41.785 --> 11:43.120
Your drawing must be pretty bad

11:43.203 --> 11:45.247
-for her to react like this.
-When it comes to drawing, you see…

11:46.164 --> 11:50.001
-What do you know about drawing?
-Okay, my bad, Ms. Art Teacher.

11:50.085 --> 11:52.170
Yeah, whatever.

11:52.254 --> 11:55.632
-I couldn't believe that when she told me…
-No way!

11:56.383 --> 11:58.593
-[gasps]
-What is it, Jenny?

11:58.677 --> 12:00.512
-Are you reading something?
-This is great.

12:00.595 --> 12:03.223
-Fifty Shades of Mr. CEO.
-[gasps, squeals]

12:03.807 --> 12:06.143
The male lead
finally confessed his feelings!

12:06.226 --> 12:07.227
[gasps] That's insane. How?

12:07.310 --> 12:10.689
He went wild. Like this. Pow!

12:10.772 --> 12:11.940
-[gasps]
-[clears throat]

12:12.566 --> 12:14.568
"You know I need you by my side."

12:14.651 --> 12:16.778
-[Yeong-jae laughs]
-"You can't quit."

12:16.862 --> 12:18.447
[both squeal]

12:19.239 --> 12:20.699
The comments say the female lead

12:20.782 --> 12:22.993
will go to the male lead's house
in the next episode.

12:23.076 --> 12:26.830
Maybe he'll act like he's sick.
It's a totally obvious trick.

12:26.913 --> 12:30.876
[breathes deeply] But those clichés
work well despite how obvious they are.

12:30.959 --> 12:31.960
-Exactly?
-Mmm.

12:32.043 --> 12:34.171
[Jenny] Why is it so exciting
when it's so cringy?

12:34.254 --> 12:37.007
Romance novels are a guilty pleasure.

12:37.090 --> 12:39.301
-You just can't resist!
-I know!

12:39.926 --> 12:43.680
Those amazing writers' pieces
are all kinda the same in a way, right?

12:43.763 --> 12:45.307
What is it?
Are you stuck with your writing?

12:45.390 --> 12:46.641
You said you finished it.

12:46.725 --> 12:48.185
What if becomes a mega hit?

12:49.019 --> 12:51.354
Mega hit? [chuckles]

12:51.438 --> 12:54.191
Aw, you'll be
the first to hear the news, then.

12:54.274 --> 12:55.358
[Ha-su] That's right.

12:58.028 --> 13:00.489
Yeah, I'm at school.
It's all right, I can talk.

13:02.073 --> 13:03.992
Oh, the movie we watched that day?

13:04.075 --> 13:05.076
I remember.

13:05.744 --> 13:08.288
A sequel? [chuckles] Are you serious?

13:09.915 --> 13:12.501
[sighs] He must be talking to that woman.

13:13.210 --> 13:16.087
[chuckles] I haven't watched it.

13:16.171 --> 13:17.547
What's so funny now?

13:23.011 --> 13:24.012
[sniffles]

13:25.931 --> 13:28.308
[downcast music playing]

13:30.143 --> 13:33.772
What's your priority among all the things
you have to do? Isn't it studying?

13:33.855 --> 13:35.065
And doing homework?

13:35.148 --> 13:36.274
[chuckles]

13:38.443 --> 13:40.111
Why would he say that? It was too random.

13:40.195 --> 13:41.196
[laughs]

13:52.123 --> 13:55.835
He's never given me that kind of smile,
not even for a second.

13:59.297 --> 14:01.132
So, this is L-O-V-E?

14:01.216 --> 14:02.217
[scoffs]

14:03.176 --> 14:05.136
How could you live
through this every time?

14:06.054 --> 14:08.473
Even now, it still hurts so much.

14:08.557 --> 14:10.767
Growing pains are inevitable.

14:13.103 --> 14:14.104
Ugh.

14:15.063 --> 14:17.148
I wish it were all just part of a novel.

14:18.066 --> 14:19.818
Then, I'd do everything as I wanted.

14:21.069 --> 14:23.280
From the confession
all the way to the ending.

14:24.823 --> 14:26.491
I'd just have it all go my way.

14:27.742 --> 14:30.453
So, are you just gonna give up?

14:30.537 --> 14:31.538
[clicks tongue]

14:32.080 --> 14:34.874
What's there to give up
when I didn't even start it?

14:36.167 --> 14:40.046
What did I tell you?
L-O-V-E has no detours.

14:41.298 --> 14:43.383
Nah. [breathes deeply]

14:45.093 --> 14:46.303
I choose to stop.

14:48.346 --> 14:50.098
I want to stop here, Go-ya.

14:51.641 --> 14:53.268
If I keep going like this,

14:53.935 --> 14:58.940
I feel like I'll get hit by a bicycle
and a car going 86 miles per hour.

14:59.566 --> 15:01.484
I might just end up being a bloody mess.

15:04.237 --> 15:06.072
It's already too hard for me.

15:08.491 --> 15:09.784
I choose to give up.

15:13.872 --> 15:15.874
In his eyes, she's a real woman.

15:15.957 --> 15:16.958
But I'm not.

15:18.418 --> 15:19.419
[sniffles]

15:20.420 --> 15:22.297
That will never change
no matter what I do.

15:24.049 --> 15:25.133
And most of all,

15:26.801 --> 15:28.094
he looks really happy.

15:29.554 --> 15:31.681
[chuckles] Isn't that what matters?

15:35.727 --> 15:36.811
[whispering] Seriously…

15:38.438 --> 15:40.023
[sobs, sniffles]

15:42.484 --> 15:44.194
[inhales sharply, sighs]

15:50.659 --> 15:52.077
Mmm, this is delicious.

15:53.787 --> 15:55.830
Hey. Where were you today?

15:57.374 --> 15:59.668
Did you meet up
with that friend of yours, Na Deul-i?

15:59.751 --> 16:01.169
-[laughs]
-What're you talking about?

16:01.252 --> 16:02.379
She's back in Seoul.

16:02.921 --> 16:04.089
Nah, you're lying.

16:05.131 --> 16:06.716
I can tell you saw her.

16:07.509 --> 16:10.261
You're going out with her?
What is it? Tell me, come on.

16:10.929 --> 16:12.722
Did you decide to get back together? Huh?

16:12.806 --> 16:15.517
-Eat your food.
-He's changing the subject.

16:16.685 --> 16:19.229
What is it? Don't be shy.

16:19.896 --> 16:23.900
Are you embarrassed, dear? How cute.

16:23.983 --> 16:26.069
Hey, he said no, knock it off.

16:26.569 --> 16:28.697
-Just eat your food.
-Just think about it.

16:29.197 --> 16:31.366
So many girls approached him for his looks

16:31.449 --> 16:33.576
only to back away
once they got to know him.

16:33.660 --> 16:35.954
-Aw, poor them.
-Yeah. Tons of them.

16:36.037 --> 16:37.038
-Mmm.
-Yeah.

16:37.122 --> 16:40.583
I was worried that he might end up
with some crazy evil wizard

16:40.667 --> 16:43.169
that would just spend his entire life
throwing curses on Earth-- Ooh!

16:44.295 --> 16:45.880
-Guys!
-Ugh, you're making a mess.

16:45.964 --> 16:48.341
Your moves are totally predictable.
It doesn't hurt at all!

16:48.425 --> 16:50.552
-Predict this, then!
-Guys, we're at the table!

16:50.635 --> 16:52.137
Stop acting like kids!

16:52.220 --> 16:54.973
-You can't avoid a single hit.
-I'm hitting you way more.

16:57.976 --> 16:59.811
-Yoon's confession is a twist.
-I didn't expect Yoon

16:59.894 --> 17:02.147
-to hit him with a confession.
-It's logically unexplainable,

17:02.230 --> 17:03.481
but emotionally perfect.

17:03.565 --> 17:05.150
[scoffs] See?

17:05.233 --> 17:07.610
Everyone likes his confession.

17:07.694 --> 17:09.904
It's not random. [chuckles]

17:16.536 --> 17:19.122
[commentor] Maybe the writer
goes to Murim Girls' High.

17:19.205 --> 17:22.041
[unsettling music playing]

17:22.125 --> 17:23.376
[gasps]

17:25.295 --> 17:28.006
What… What the heck? [breathes shakily]

17:28.089 --> 17:30.133
Does she go to my school?

17:30.967 --> 17:32.594
She was probably just saying it, right?

17:32.677 --> 17:34.804
-[breathes shakily]
-[phone chimes]

17:34.888 --> 17:35.889
Who's still awake? Huh?

17:35.972 --> 17:36.973
11TH GRADE CLASS 2 GROUP CHAT
DAN-JI

17:38.349 --> 17:41.227
[sighing, breathing shakily]

17:55.325 --> 17:56.826
[students chattering]

18:02.999 --> 18:05.794
DOES THE WRITER
GO TO MURIM GIRLS' HIGH?

18:07.212 --> 18:08.671
Do you read web novels?

18:08.755 --> 18:10.298
[student] No, not these days.

18:11.132 --> 18:14.636
-Do you read them too?
-[chuckles] I'm not talking about me.

18:14.719 --> 18:16.513
There's this web novel
with main characters

18:16.596 --> 18:19.307
who are almost identical
to our Korean literature,

18:19.390 --> 18:22.060
math, PE, and Japanese language teachers.

18:22.143 --> 18:23.686
What? Seriously?

18:24.729 --> 18:26.606
One of the main characters
is a math genius.

18:26.689 --> 18:31.194
And his personality is just like
our homeroom teacher. Isn't it crazy?

18:31.277 --> 18:32.862
-Our math teacher? I know.
-No way.

18:32.946 --> 18:36.241
Ugh, I'm dying to know who the writer is.

18:36.324 --> 18:38.868
If it were me,
I wouldn't be able to keep it a secret.

18:39.828 --> 18:41.287
What do you think, Eui-ju?

18:43.748 --> 18:45.333
About what?

18:45.416 --> 18:47.502
If it were you,
would you be able to hide it?

18:49.379 --> 18:50.588
Hide what?

18:52.966 --> 18:55.718
What's with that straight face?
I was just asking.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.681
[scoffs]

19:01.307 --> 19:02.559
Oh, who could it be?

19:17.115 --> 19:19.742
[Eui-ju] She sounded like
she already knew everything.

19:19.826 --> 19:21.369
[chattering]

19:21.452 --> 19:23.079
It's good. Mmm.

19:23.162 --> 19:25.039
Did you hand in the math assignment? Huh?

19:27.083 --> 19:29.377
Should I just ask her to keep it a secret?

19:30.044 --> 19:32.630
What if I do
and she lets the entire school know?

19:32.714 --> 19:33.965
What do I do now?

19:34.883 --> 19:35.925
Huh?

19:36.634 --> 19:38.636
I asked about the math assignment.

19:38.720 --> 19:41.222
You might get demerits
if you don't turn it in.

19:41.306 --> 19:43.641
Oh. Right, I should.

19:43.725 --> 19:45.059
I'll do it later today.

19:45.643 --> 19:47.979
Eui-ju. Eui-ju, don't forget, okay?

19:48.062 --> 19:49.063
[chuckles]

19:51.524 --> 19:53.443
What's wrong? You okay?

19:53.526 --> 19:54.527
Uh-huh.

19:55.570 --> 19:57.655
[Dan-ji] This rolled omelet is so good.

19:59.240 --> 20:01.409
[pensive music playing]

20:01.492 --> 20:03.244
[inhales deeply, sighs]

20:08.249 --> 20:09.250
[breathes shakily]

20:10.376 --> 20:12.921
One of the main characters
is a math genius.

20:13.004 --> 20:16.132
And his personality is just like
our homeroom teacher.

20:16.215 --> 20:17.216
Isn't it crazy?

20:17.926 --> 20:19.218
What do you think, Eui-ju?

20:20.470 --> 20:22.263
If it were you,
would you be able to hide it?

20:22.889 --> 20:25.892
Ugh. What if everyone knows
by the time I get there tomorrow?

20:25.975 --> 20:27.894
[sighs, exhales sharply]

20:37.654 --> 20:38.780
[groans, sniffles]

20:41.407 --> 20:42.408
[PA chiming]

20:42.492 --> 20:44.577
CHAPTER 41:
NOTHING STAYS A SECRET FOREVER

20:44.661 --> 20:47.246
-[student 1] Hey, hurry over here.
-She fell asleep during class again.

20:47.330 --> 20:49.290
You went to the cafeteria, didn't you?

20:49.374 --> 20:51.584
[student 1] I didn't hear from you
all night long.

20:51.668 --> 20:54.212
Yeah! Oh my God, we had so much fun.

20:54.295 --> 20:56.547
Yeah, we drove in the park, and then we…

20:56.631 --> 20:58.800
-Hello.
-[class] Hello.

21:02.345 --> 21:04.973
All right. We're starting
Gongmudohaga today, right?

21:05.056 --> 21:06.933
Please turn to page 168.

21:07.642 --> 21:08.893
Mr. Yoon.

21:09.686 --> 21:10.687
Yes?

21:10.770 --> 21:12.772
Is she going to expose it during class?

21:13.606 --> 21:14.816
She wouldn't.

21:14.899 --> 21:18.194
-So, is everything up to here on the exam?
-Yes, that's right.

21:23.908 --> 21:26.703
Are you okay?
You're up to something, aren't you?

21:27.537 --> 21:28.538
Nah.

21:29.956 --> 21:32.000
[Yoon] "My love, do not cross that river."

21:32.667 --> 21:35.086
"Yet, you have crossed it in the end."

21:36.045 --> 21:39.048
Should I tell everyone now?

21:40.049 --> 21:42.510
That might be better
than waiting around worried.

21:43.136 --> 21:44.470
Someone else will tell on me.

21:47.223 --> 21:48.266
Or should I just…

21:50.268 --> 21:53.896
DO YOU WANT
TO DELETE THIS NOVEL?

21:56.691 --> 21:57.692
[sighs]

22:04.407 --> 22:05.408
Jenny.

22:07.618 --> 22:08.661
-Hi.
-Hi.

22:12.373 --> 22:15.084
Did you know someone in our class
writes web novels?

22:15.710 --> 22:16.711
Really?

22:17.587 --> 22:19.380
You and Eui-ju were talking about it.

22:21.424 --> 22:22.884
Oh.

22:22.967 --> 22:25.970
So, I thought you'd know who she was.

22:26.554 --> 22:28.389
[chuckles] I have no clue.

22:28.473 --> 22:29.474
[amusing music playing]

22:29.557 --> 22:35.396
Well, it's a BL novel written
with our teachers as the main characters.

22:36.105 --> 22:37.356
Crazy!

22:38.399 --> 22:39.734
It will come out someday.

22:40.735 --> 22:43.738
Nothing stays a secret forever. Right?

22:49.035 --> 22:50.119
[softly] Dang.

22:50.203 --> 22:51.871
[breathes deeply]

22:55.124 --> 22:56.334
Hey, Eui-ju, look.

22:56.417 --> 22:59.837
I took a pic of this cat
going to drawing lesson yesterday.

22:59.921 --> 23:01.005
Isn't it so adorable?

23:04.509 --> 23:05.885
What's going on?

23:06.886 --> 23:07.929
Mmm.

23:09.013 --> 23:10.348
[phone buzzes]

23:11.224 --> 23:14.268
[menacing music plays]

23:15.603 --> 23:16.604
SPECIAL OFFER FOR THE INTERNET

23:17.980 --> 23:19.107
[breathes deeply]

23:21.109 --> 23:22.401
-Hey.
-[gasps] Huh?

23:23.152 --> 23:25.780
You're acting really weird.
Something's going on.

23:26.280 --> 23:28.449
[sighs] Ugh, I already said no.

23:33.579 --> 23:35.873
Sorry. You startled me.

23:37.792 --> 23:39.669
Mm-hmm. Oh, okay.

23:44.590 --> 23:46.801
[Woo-su] All right, F of x…

23:48.261 --> 23:52.890
equals the integral of x
plus 3x square plus x cube,

23:54.559 --> 23:55.977
which is negative 10.

23:56.978 --> 24:00.940
Thus, f of minus 1 comes out
to negative 10. Not too hard, right?

24:01.023 --> 24:03.442
-[class] Right.
-[Woo-su] Let's call it a day here.

24:03.526 --> 24:04.569
Good job.

24:04.652 --> 24:06.404
[class] Thank you.

24:09.448 --> 24:11.033
-[students] Goodbye.
-[Woo-su] Bye.

24:19.458 --> 24:21.294
Mr. Ga, I have a question for you.

24:23.254 --> 24:28.259
I get why C is 6 in problem number 356,
but I'm stuck on what to do next.

24:28.342 --> 24:31.304
-[Woo-su] Is this not doable for you?
-[Ha-su] It's a bit confusing.

24:32.180 --> 24:36.017
[Woo-su] If you integrate from here,
you get x cube plus 4 for g of x.

24:36.100 --> 24:38.644
Then, just evaluate g at negative 2.

24:39.854 --> 24:42.315
Keep in mind that the product rule
can be used this way, okay?

24:43.274 --> 24:44.442
-Okay.
-Good job.

24:44.525 --> 24:45.526
Oh. Mr. Ga.

24:49.238 --> 24:51.490
I brought this,
I thought you would like it.

24:53.910 --> 24:55.203
You didn't have to.

24:58.539 --> 25:00.499
Don't do it again, all right?

25:00.583 --> 25:01.918
Yes. Okay, sir.

25:05.129 --> 25:06.672
[Woo-su]
Do you find anything else difficult?

25:06.756 --> 25:08.716
-[Ha-su] Nothing else so far.
-[Woo-su] Good.

25:14.096 --> 25:15.139
You're still here?

25:16.682 --> 25:19.143
-Uh…
-I guess you have something to tell him.

25:19.227 --> 25:21.270
You should've asked
a question during class.

25:26.943 --> 25:29.028
-I'll be going, then.
-Bye.

25:38.329 --> 25:39.330
What is it?

25:43.042 --> 25:44.710
Mr. Ga, I think I'll have to…

25:45.795 --> 25:48.756
take a break from writing the web novel.

25:51.092 --> 25:52.093
Why?

25:52.969 --> 25:56.013
Well, I need to focus on studying.

25:56.847 --> 25:59.684
And I keep skipping homework.
You know that.

26:23.833 --> 26:25.918
Why the lack of confidence?
It's not like you.

26:26.877 --> 26:29.380
That's not it. I'm wondering…

26:30.131 --> 26:32.466
if I should just take
a short break from writing.

26:34.343 --> 26:36.387
I don't know what gave you
that kind of idea,

26:37.263 --> 26:39.557
but think back to
when you first started writing it.

26:40.224 --> 26:42.518
Remember exactly
why you started the novel,

26:43.144 --> 26:45.021
the first intention that drove you.

26:45.104 --> 26:46.939
[tender music playing]

26:47.023 --> 26:48.232
The answer must lie there.

26:49.233 --> 26:52.361
If you actually want to quit writing,
or if it's just an excuse…

26:56.532 --> 26:57.783
to get better at writing.

26:58.784 --> 27:02.413
Wasn't that the reason
that you started this whole thing?

27:02.496 --> 27:04.999
[breathes deeply]

27:05.082 --> 27:07.418
I'm not sure
if it's the real reason, though.

27:07.918 --> 27:12.465
[sniffles] But I do feel a bit better when
I hear you put it into words like that.

27:17.386 --> 27:18.387
Here, cheer up.

27:22.600 --> 27:25.102
[ominous music playing]

27:25.186 --> 27:26.354
[gasps]

27:33.069 --> 27:34.070
[exhales sharply]

27:36.280 --> 27:39.075
[breathes shakily]

27:39.950 --> 27:42.912
[rock music playing]
